  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> faint (+1), moderate (+2/+3), or strong Enhancement (+4/+5); <strong>CL</strong> 3rd (+1), 6th (+2), 9th (+3), 12th (+4), or 15th (+5)<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> hands; <strong>Price</strong> 1,000 gp (+1), 4,000 gp (+2), 9,000 gp (+3), 16,000 gp (+4), or 25,000 gp (+5); <strong>Weight</strong> 1&nbsp;lb.</p>\n<p>This gauntlet always comes in pairs, both of which must be worn to obtain its effects. While worn, the gauntlet of maneuvers grants a +1 to +5 competence bonus to one combat maneuver. The wearer receives the same bonus to their CMD against the same combat maneuver.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nForge Charm, Enhancement sphere; <strong>Cost</strong> 500 gp (+1), 2,000 gp (+2), 4,500 gp (+3), 8,000 gp (+4), or 12,500 gp (+5)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/charms#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
